OL,3,GNEWSAPatient questioned surgery before
OL,4,Adeath, inquest hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA grandfather-of-12 from Brighton who
OL,7,Fdied following surgery questioned if
OL,8,Fhis procedure had been "a mistake" as
OL,9,Fhis condition deteriorated, an inquest
OL,10,Fhas heard.
OL,12,FArthur Brooke Craig died on 26 June
OL,13,F2024 at the Royal Sussex Hospital (RSH)
OL,14,Fin Brighton where he had been admitted
OL,15,Ffor investigative intestinal surgery
OL,16,Fearlier that month.
OL,18,FThe consultant colorectal surgeon
OL,19,Fresponsible, Marc Lamah, was questioned
OL,20,Fat Horsham Coroners Court on Wednesday
OL,21,Fover his choice of treatment for the
OL,22,F77-year-old.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
